      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Malvern%2C_Iowa",
      "category": "economy",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "A 1892 electric generation plant powered the town’s first municipal water system, a first for the region.",
